{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-chronicles 35:15","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"pcm","chapter":35,"translation":"And di singer-dem, pikin-dem of Asaf, for dia station, as di command of Dawid, and Asaf, and Heyman, and Yedutun, wey be seer of di king; and di gate-keeper-dem for gate and gate; dem no get chance to comot from dia work, because dia broda-dem di Leviyim bin prepare for dem.","tokens":[{"surface":"והמשררים","gloss":"and di singer-dem"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"pikin-dem of"},{"surface":"אסף","gloss":"Asaf"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"מעמדם","gloss":"dia station"},{"surface":"כמצות","gloss":"as di command of"},{"surface":"דויד","gloss":"Dawid"},{"surface":"ואסף","gloss":"and Asaf"},{"surface":"והימן","gloss":"and Heyman"},{"surface":"וידתון","gloss":"and Yedutun"},{"surface":"חוזה","gloss":"seer of"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"di king"},{"surface":"והשערים","gloss":"and di gate-keeper-dem"},{"surface":"לשער","gloss":"for gate"},{"surface":"ושער","gloss":"and gate"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"dem no get"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"chance"},{"surface":"לסור","gloss":"to comot"},{"surface":"מעל","gloss":"from"},{"surface":"עבדתם","gloss":"dia work"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"אחיהם","gloss":"dia broda-dem"},{"surface":"הלוים","gloss":"di Leviyim"},{"surface":"הכינו","gloss":"bin prepare"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"for dem"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:17:03.226829260Z","model":"glm-5.2"}